# Workshop ids of the mod's HARD dependencies that the staging script's built-in table does not
# know. Read in every pass, the bare one included, and it resolves without activating anything:
# what is staged is still what Mod/About/About.xml declares plus what a named pass adds.
#
# astryl.tailormade is a hard dependency of the mod. Without a line here the staging dies with
# "no Workshop id known for astryl.tailormade" before it plays a scenario, in every pass.
# It was once listed in wsl-deps.wdi-ab.map instead, which fixed only that pass and staged it twice.
astryl.tailormade   3756915448
